@title Cabinet toolbar: a project with two panels fits at 1366 wide
@area Cabinet
# All panels is shown only with more than one panel; its width must count in the fold so the bar
# folds into More instead of needing a sideways scroll (CV-200 at 1366 did).
open qa/fixtures/cable-cross.novo
wait 20
resize 1366 768
wait 10
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot cabinet-two-panels
expect "All panels"
check_layout
